  "comment": {
    "text": "Short status label for an app (Files, Rooms, Forms, AI Agents) that is not installed, i.e. switched off by the administrator. Shown as a badge on the app card on the Dashboard and as a group caption in the left sidebar above the list of such apps. Opposite of \"Installed\"; keep it short.",
